msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Karaoke is a rhythm game in which you press buttons shown\r\n"
"on-screen in time with a song. Simply press the indicated\r\n"
"button when the cursor reaches it. Make sure to press the\r\n"
"correct buttons at the right time to get the most points."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"The better your timing, the more points you will get.\r\n"
"If your timing is really off, your press won't count\r\n"
"even if it was the correct button."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Do your best to keep time with the song to rack up the\r\n"
"points and get a high score."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Complete the game by singing (or letting your partner sing)\r\n"
"a song from start to finish. Familiarize yourself with each\r\n"
"song and perfect your technique as you aim for a new high\r\n"
"score."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"<Color:14>You can choose to switch between English and Japanese lyrics\r\n"
"in the Options Menu.<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Your time is almost up. Please bring the microphones and your check to the "
"front before leaving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Your time is almost up. Would you like to extend your session for 500 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "(I don't have any more money on me. I'd better stop.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Yeah, sounds good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Thank you, I'll add more time. Please enjoy your session."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Understood. Please bring the microphones and check to the\r\n"
"front before you leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I'd like more time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "No, thank you."
msgstr ""

